  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "3e25de2b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 构建物理模型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8e950239",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 构建物理模型的基本原则\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6c2185f3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Engee**允许您使用表示真实物理系统组件的块以及它们之间的连接来构建物理模型。 与此同时，您不需要创建描述物理系统行为的微分方程。 您只需要使用表示物理连接的线连接组件。\n\n启动模型时，Engee对其进行分析，合成需要求解的方程（或方程组），然后对这些方程进行数值解。 这就是Engee中物理建模和动态建模的区别。 在动态建模的情况下，用户必须自己设置方程。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3d7b79a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 求解器设置\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dc339d28",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "每个物理模型都需要**求解器配置**块（求解器设置）。 它位于**物理建模**库中，在**实用程序**部分。 该单元的连接位置无关紧要。 例如，在构建电路模型时，**求解器配置**单元可以连接到电路中的任何点。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 блок Solver Configuration_2.png](attachment:2 блок Solver Configuration_2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 блок Solver Configuration_2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "93cc4084",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 参考点\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "200390bf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "每个物理模型必须至少包含一个**参考**块（参考点）。 每个域是不同的。 例如，对于\"电\"域，这样的块是**电参考**(电接地)。 它在图书馆**物理建模->基础->电力->元素**。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 блок Electrical Reference.png](attachment:2 блок Electrical Reference.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 блок Electrical Reference.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d77eaf08",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 传感器\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fd26d53e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "为了测量物理模型中的变量，使用特殊块-**传感器**。 \"电力\"领域中最简单的传感器如下:\n***电流传感器**（电流表）, \n***电压传感器**（电压表）。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 блоки амперметра и вольтметра.png](attachment:2 блоки амперметра и вольтметра.png)\n\n</div>\n \n这些块在库**物理建模->基础->电力->传感器**。 它们分别测量电流和电压。 这些单元模拟相应的实验室仪器，并以相同的方式连接到电路：电压表可以测量电路的任何两个点的电压。:\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 подключение вольтметра.png](attachment:2 подключение вольтметра.png)\n\n</div>\n\n电流表可以测量分支电路中的电流.:\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 подключение амперметра.png](attachment:2 подключение амперметра.png)\n\n</div>\n\n测量值被发送到传感器的输出端口，用黑色箭头表示。 这个端口可以连接到**基本**库块，并且来自它的信号可以被编程，绘制，写入**Engee**工作区或文件。\n\n如果您反转传感器的极性（即交换端口+和-），测量值将反转其符号。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 блоки амперметра и вольтметра.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "2 подключение вольтметра.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "2 подключение амперметра.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d90bf88c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 初始参数值\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb76200b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "您可以使用\"设置\"对话框设置块参数的初始值。 例如，如果要模拟电容器在初始值时的放电 `5` V(V)，可以在**Initial Targets>电容器电压**的部分设定电容器电压的初始值(**Value**)。 \n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 окно настроек блока Capacitor.png](attachment:2 окно настроек блока Capacitor.png)\n\n</div>\n\n初始化模型时，求解器会尝试满足指定的要求，但如果与其他参数存在冲突，则可能不会使用此值。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 окно настроек блока Capacitor.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d7050ad0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## RC电路模型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "92ee1a29",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在此示例中，您将使用\"电力\"域中的块来构建以下RC电路的模型:\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 схема RC-цепи_2.png](attachment:2 схема RC-цепи_2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 схема RC-цепи_2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1d49199",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "933f5c36",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "创建一个新模型。 将以下块添加到模型中:\r\n***电阻器**（电阻器）,\r\n***电容器**（电容器）,\r\n***电气参考**（电气接地）,\r\n***求解器配置**（求解器设置）。\r\n\r\n前三个块在库**物理建模->基础->电力->元素**中，最后一个在库**物理建模->实用程序**中。 不要连接块。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1d118005",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cf093547",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 задание 1 решение.png](attachment:2 задание 1 решение.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 задание 1 решение.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
