    },
    {
      "id": "f36e9b2e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "728a6699",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "设置块参数的初始值:\r\n\r\n1. 在**电阻**块的设置窗口中，将**电阻**参数的值设置为 `100` 欧姆(Ohms)。\r\n2. 在**电容**单元的设置窗口中，将**容量**参数的值设置为 `1e-5` F(F)，且电容电压初始值(**Initial Targets->Capacitor voltage->Value**)等于 `5` V（在）。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9d96ccf8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
