    {
      "id": "93b98744",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "264bd047",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "连接块: \r\n1. 依次连接**电阻**和**电容**块，形成闭环。 请注意，电阻和电容块具有正（+）和负（-）端口。 将电阻块的负端口连接到电容块的正端口。 \r\n2. 将**电气参考**和**求解器配置**单元连接到电路中的任何点。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8621db11",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
