    {
      "id": "97f00fc5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b02a8874",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "完成模型的构建:\r\n\r\n1. 在模型设置窗口中，将步长设置为 `0.001` c，以及仿真时间 – `0.1` C.\r\n2. 运行模型。 绘制电容器两端电压降的时间依赖性。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "84a23425",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
