    {
      "id": "22e296eb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 用摩擦旋转的车轮的模型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ea6df10b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "对于其他主题区域的建模，执行相同的操作：添加物理组件，在它们之间创建连接，添加求解器配置块（**Solver Configuration**），与主题区域对应的参考点（**Reference**），并指定组件参数值。 在以下任务中，您将应用这些步骤来模拟由于摩擦而减速的旋转轮。 您将使用力学域中的旋转元素块。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 велотренажёр_2.png](attachment:2 велотренажёр_2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 велотренажёр_2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3f305f5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "45e9619a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "要模拟摩擦旋转的车轮，您需要**惯性**块和**旋转阻尼器**块（机械旋转系统中的粘性阻尼器）。 它们在库**物理建模-\\>基础-\\>力学-\\>旋转-\\>元素**。 \n\n1. 创建一个新模型。\n2. 将以下块添加到模型中:\n\n***惯性**（惯性）,\n***旋转阻尼器**（机械旋转系统中的粘性阻尼器）,\n***机械旋转参考**（机械旋转系统的参考点）来自同一库。 该块表示角速度为零的点。\n***求解器配置**（求解器设置）。\n\n不要连接块。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b75015c2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1776e034",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "![2 задание 9 решение.png](attachment:2 задание 9 решение.png)\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 задание 9 решение.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e69823f4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n该图示出了该系统的图。:\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![2 схема колеса.png](attachment:2 схема колеса.png)\n\n</div>\n\n机械旋转块有端口R和C。就像\"电力\"域中的端口（+）和（-）一样，这些端口定义了块参数的符号。 例如，由**惯性**块建模的旋转轮的角速度由表达式确定:\n\n$$\\omega=\\omega_R−\\omega_C,$$\n\n哪里 $\\omega$ -相对角速度, $\\omega_R$ 和 $\\omega_C$ -分别在端口R和C处的绝对角速度。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2 схема колеса.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "94ae9a3c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务7\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ac6e027d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "按上图依次连接**惯量**、**旋转阻尼器**和**机械旋转基准**块。 选择**旋转阻尼器**单元的方向，使**惯性**单元连接到端口C（到阻尼器的输入），参考点连接到端口R（到阻尼器的输出）。  将求解器设置单元连接到模型中的任何点。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
