    {
      "id": "17bfeb86",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务8\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "95eafd56",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "设置块参数的值:\r\n1. 在**旋转阻尼器**单元的设置窗口中，将**阻尼系数**参数的值设置为 `0.01` N$\\cdot$m$\\cdot$（glad/s）。\r\n2. 在**惯性**块的设置窗口中，将角速度的初始值（**初始目标->旋转速度->值**）设置为 `10` rad/s(rad/s)。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9f154939",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
